{"items":[{"id":"ls-001","kata":"Umpan","kana":"Umpan","romaji":"","arti":"Pakan ternak","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-002","kata":"Pengumpanan","kana":"Pengumpanan","romaji":"","arti":"Memberi pakan ternak pada ternak","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-003","kata":"Makan pilih","kana":"Makan pilih","romaji":"","arti":"Ternak hanya makan yang disukainya saja dari dalam pakan ternak di wadah pakan, dan menyisakan pakan yang tidak disukainya. Disebut juga dengan selective feeding.","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-004","kata":"Staphylococcus aureus","kana":"Staphylococcus aureus","romaji":"","arti":"Bakteri penyebab mastitis yang sulit disembuhkan bila berkembang biak di dalam ambing.","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-005","kata":"Volume asupan bahan kering","kana":"Volume asupan bahan kering","romaji":"","arti":"Pakan ternak yang tidak mengandung kelembaban disebut dengan bahan kering, dan volume (kg) bahan kering yang dimakan dalam 1 hari disebut dengan volume asupan bahan…","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-006","kata":"Tes kelompok sapi","kana":"Tes kelompok sapi","romaji":"","arti":"Sistem yang melakukan pemeriksaan sebulan sekali atas kondisi volume susu, kualitas susu, dan perkembangbiakan sapi perah di peternak.","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-007","kata":"Berhenti makan","kana":"Berhenti makan","romaji":"","arti":"Kondisi sapi yang volume asupan pakan ternaknya menurun secara tiba-tiba.","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-008","kata":"Jumlah hari kosong","kana":"Jumlah hari kosong","romaji":"","arti":"Jumlah hari sejak melahirkan hingga fertilisasi.","cat":"Istilah peternakan","bab":"bab3","src":["b3s1"]},{"id":"ls-009","kata":"Fase close up","kana":"Fase close up","romaji":"","arti":"Fase akhir masa kering pada susu perah. Periode